      "area": "preview",
      "title": "缺省关闭与旧设备",
      "operations": ["renewLiveImageViewer", "getDeviceLiveImageState"],
      "dependsOn": [],
      "requiredInputs": [],
      "steps": ["对未开白名单的隔离设备查询状态；旧设备继续原 Sync/MQTT/归档。"],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "id": "PV01-A1",
          "expected": "缺行/false 返回403 FORBIDDEN，不能记作IDLE"
        },
        {
          "id": "PV01-A2",
          "expected": "旧设备无新增轮询；旧请求仍可使用"
        }
      ],
      "evidenceKinds": ["HTTP", "DB"],
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "requiredVariants": []
    },
    {
      "id": "PV02",
      "area": "preview",
      "title": "首次查看与五个接口",
      "operations": [
        "renewLiveImageViewer",
        "getDeviceLiveImageState",
        "uploadDeviceLiveImageFrame",
        "getLatestLiveImage",
        "releaseLiveImageViewer"
      ],
      "dependsOn": ["PV01"],
      "requiredInputs": [],
      "steps": [
        "用预先单独准入的测试身份 PUT viewer，无请求体；设备 GET state；按返回流上传新 JPEG；GET latest；DELETE 本页租约。"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "id": "PV02-A1",
          "expected": "PUT200及30秒租约/10秒续租/2秒读取"
        },
        {
          "id": "PV02-A2",
          "expected": "ACTIVE给当前streamId/5秒查询/2秒上传"
        },
        {
          "id": "PV02-A3",
          "expected": "POST200且latest READY的字节Hash与样例一致"
        },
        {
          "id": "PV02-A4",
          "expected": "DELETE204，之后旧流不再可见"
        }
      ],
      "evidenceKinds": ["HTTP", "DDB"],
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "requiredVariants": []
    },
